# Claude Code Adapter

This repository uses Agentic Project Governance (APG).

Read:

- `/GOVERNANCE.md`
- `/.governance/manifest.yaml`
- applicable scoped instructions
- authoritative project sources declared by the manifest and relevant to the task
- only the policies and optional extensions required by the current task

Do not assume `PROJECT.md` exists unless it is declared as a project source.

Canonical project governance remains in the APG contract, not in this adapter.
